          "episode_number": 2,
          "name": "Men Who Connect",
          "description": "Yoigoshi refuses to practice being an anti because he doesn't like the defense formation commonly known as a \"chain\" where they have hold hands. However, even though he rejects the idea of holding hands with other guys, his raid success rate against them is zero. But after observing Iura, and second years Misumi Kyohei and Date Shinji, Yoigoshi declares that he has discovered a surefire way to win — a raiding hat trick.",
